The batch implementation in this repository is a from-scratch cmd-only
rewrite of the PowerShell original. See README.md, section "Attribution and
differences from upstream", for the intentional behavioral differences. The
most significant one: in this implementation JAVA_HOME always points at the
JEnv directory (at both the user and system scope) and a real JDK path is
never written into it, whereas the upstream implementation sets JAVA_HOME to
the selected real JDK.

